    "latencyTargetMs": 40,
    "costBudget": 2200
  },
  "explanation": [
    "Accept fast, deliver later: the API validates and appends to a durable log, and returns. Workers consume at their own pace and retry failures with backoff.",
    "Consumer capacity must exceed the producer rate, or lag grows forever. Size workers for the peak with headroom.",
    "Real systems add per-user preferences and rate limits (don't send 50 pushes a minute), and dead-letter queues for messages that keep failing."
  ]
